 - Controllers page: SDL3 gamepads, built-in (read-only, "Duplicate to edit") and user profiles, remapping, input test, a system selector; only mapped inputs are listed.
 - Data-driven systems ([ADR 0024](adr/0024-system-template-and-game-boy.md), [guide](guides/adding-a-system.md)): one embedded JSON per system (`nds`, `3ds`, `gb`, `gbc`, `gba`), reconciled into the database at start without touching admin state. System manifests carry input maps, game identity and display layout.
 - Nintendo DS: melonDS DS, firmware files fetched from the server in native mode; the app shows "Firmware required" / "Firmware missing" instead of launching without them.
