+### 0.23 Together
+
+Decided by Fabio on 2026-10-21 (as 0.20; renumbered on 2026-10-22 and 2026-10-23). Decisions: [ADR 0033](adr/0033-together.md); leftovers and Fabio's tests are in the [roadmap](roadmap.md#023-leftovers). The UI is drawn in the Uzume design (speaking mark, mixer popover, People and Chat tabs, notifications); no own design round. Dependency chains: online status -> notifications -> ready check (same presence over WSS); chat -> audio mixer stage 2 -> voice chat; viewer role -> controller hand-over. Behaviour: [features](features.md), [app guide](guides/app.md), [plugin API](guides/plugin-api.md).
+
+- [x] Done (package 1): online status, who is online and what they play, "Watch" and "Invite" from the list (S)
+- [x] Done (package 2, app): notifications as app toasts and bell for Session started, invite and run event, switchable per kind (S-M)
+- [x] Done (package 3): ready check and shared pause for runs and Sessions over WSS (`together_v1`) (S-M)
+- [x] Done (package 4): Session and run chat with emotes, pings and mentions, run history stored on the server (migration `run_chat_messages`), panel tabs in the app (M)
+- [x] Done (package 5): viewer role cleanly separated, quality per viewer with selection and latency display (M)
+- [x] Done (package 6): audio mixer stage 2 with channels game, tiles and plugin sounds (`fb.sound`) (M)
+- [x] Done (package 7): voice chat with signaling over WSS, microphone, push-to-talk, volume per person, host mute and ducking (L)
+- [x] Done (package 8): controller hand-over, a viewer controls P2 or takes over P1, the host confirms (M-L)
+
